#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Built on the Chromium Embedded Framework. Karere 4.0 replaces the WebKitGTK "
"backend with the Chromium Embedded Framework, bringing full video attachment "
"playback (H.264/AAC), multi-account support with isolated sessions, per-"
"account zoom, and a faster, more compatible rendering engine while keeping "
"the same native GTK4/libadwaita shell."
msgstr ""
"Tógtha anois ar CEF/Chromium 148. Cuireann Karere 4.0 creat Chromium "
"Embedded Framework in ionad an chúláis WebKitGTK, ag tabhairt seinm iomlán "
"ceangaltán físe (H.264/AAC), tacaíocht ilchuntais le seisiúin scoite, súmáil "
"in aghaidh an chuntais, agus inneall rindreála níos tapúla agus níos "
"comhoiriúnaí, agus an blaosc dúchasach GTK4/libadwaita céanna á coinneáil."

