#: data/io.github.tobagin.karere.metainfo.xml.in:24
msgid ""
"Karere brings WhatsApp to your Linux desktop with a native look and feel. It "
"integrates seamlessly with your environment, offering a clean, modern "
"interface that respects your system's theme and workflow. By wrapping "
"WhatsApp Web, it ensures you have access to all the latest features while "
"adding powerful desktop-specific capabilities."
msgstr ""
"Tugann Karere WhatsApp chuig do dheasc Linux le cuma agus mothú dúchasach. "
"Comhtháthaíonn sé go réidh le do thimpeallacht, ag tairiscint comhéadan glan "
"nua-aimseartha a urramaíonn téama agus sreabhadh oibre do chórais. Trí "
"WhatsApp Web a fhilleadh, cinntíonn sé go bhfuil rochtain agat ar na gnéithe "
"is déanaí go léir agus é ag cur cumais shainiúla deisce cumhachtacha leis."

